              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lina lithi: Indlela yeNkosi kayilingani. O ndlu ka-Israyeli, ngizokwahlulela, kube yilowo nalowo ngokwezindlela zakhe.",
