              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngomnyaka weshumi nambili wokudingiswa kwethu, ngenyanga yeshumi, ngolwesihlanu lwenyanga, kwafika kimi owaphunyuka eJerusalema, wathi: “Umuzi unqotshiwe.",
