          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndodana yomuntu, abahlala kulawo manxiwa ezwe lakwa-Israyeli bakhuluma bathi: U-Abrahama wayemunye, wadla ifa lezwe; kodwa thina sibaningi; izwe linikezwe thina njengefa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.24",
