          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho-ke yithi kubo: Itsho njalo iNkosi uJehova; Nidla okunegazi, niphakamisele amehlo enu ezithombeni zenu, nichitha igazi; futhi niyakudla ifa lezwe na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
